              "url": "https://www.ihes.fr/~ruelle/PUBLICATIONS/%5B28%5D.pdf",
              "locator": "Sections 1–2, printed pp.131–141 / PDF pp.4–14: cell superstability, lower regularity, finite-volume partition functions and correlation estimates."
            },
